.TH AVR\-SKILL\-INSTALL 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-install \- Install the bundled Avrea skill.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill install
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install the bundled Avrea skill.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr skill install
    avr skill install --target codex
    avr skill install --target claude
    avr skill install --target all --force
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Agent host to install for. (choices: codex, claude, all; default: all)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing modified or unmanaged skill.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-status (1),
.BR avr-skill-uninstall (1),
.BR avr-skill-update (1)
